{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_188_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，王正月，暨齊平。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"平者，成也。暨猶暨暨也，暨者，不得已也。以外及內曰暨。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"二、三月，公如楚。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"三、叔孫婼如齊莅盟。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"莅，位也。內之前定之辭謂之莅，外之前定之辭謂之來。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"四、夏，四月，甲辰，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"五、秋，八月，戊辰，衞侯惡卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"鄉曰衞齊惡，今曰衞侯惡，此何為君臣同名也？君子不奪人名，不奪人親之所名，重其所以來也。王父名子也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"六、九月，公至自楚。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有一月，癸未，季孫宿卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_188_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_188","textTraditional":"八、十有二月，葬衞襄公。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}